<title>USA: Coventry names head of health plan unit.</title>
<headline>Coventry names head of health plan unit.</headline>
<dateline>NASHVILLE, Tenn. 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Coventry Corp said it has named Robert Mayer president and chief executive of HealthAmerica Pennsylvania, its largest health plan.</p>
<p>Mayer, who was senior vice president of Coventry and chief operating officer of HealthAmerica Pennsylvania, succeeds F. G. Merkel, who is to remain with Coventry in a consulting role.</p>
<p>Coventry is a managed health care company.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
